{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cab.zju.edu.cn/chinese/2026/0822/c11167a3196178/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:12.643879+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cab.zju.edu.cn/chinese/2026/0822/c11167a3196178/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span>报名流程请参照浙江大学研究生院通知要求<a href=\"http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/28470/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/28470/list.htm</a></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>其中申请直接攻博学生请注意，</span><strong><span>外语水平须符合下列条件之一：</span></strong></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>学术学位博士</span><a href=\"http://www.cab.zju.edu.cn/chinese/2026/0822/c11167a3196178/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>全国大学英语六级成绩总分</span></a></span><span><span>460</span></span><span><span>分及以上</span></span><span><span>；</span><a href=\"http://www.cab.zju.edu.cn/chinese/2026/0822/c11167a3196178/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>专业学位博士全国大学英语六级成绩总分</span></a></span><span><span><span>426</span></span></span><span><span><span>分及以上。</span></span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span>英语专业八级成绩合格。</span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>  </span><span>WSK</span></span><span>（</span><span>PETS 5</span><span>）达到合格标准。</span></p><p><span>4. </span><a href=\"http://www.cab.zju.edu.cn/chinese/2026/0822/c11167a3196178/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"http://www.cab.zju.edu.cn/chinese/2026/0822/c11167a3196178/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>学术学位</span></span></a><a href=\"http://www.cab.zju.edu.cn/chinese/2026/0822/c11167a3196178/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>博士</span></span></span></a><span><span>雅思（学术类）</span></span><span><span>6.0</span></span><span><span>及以上</span></span><span>；专业学位博士雅思（学术类）</span><span>5.5</span><span>及以上。</span></p><p><span>5. </span><a href=\"http://www.cab.zju.edu.cn/chinese/2026/0822/c11167a3196178/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>学术学位博士新托福</span></a><span><span>90</span></span><span><span>及以上</span></span><span>；专业学位博士新托福</span><span>80</span><span>及以上</span><span>.</span></p><p><a href=\"http://www.cab.zju.edu.cn/chinese/2026/0822/c11167a3196178/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"http://www.cab.zju.edu.cn/chinese/2026/0822/c11167a3196178/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>1-3</span></span></a><span><span><span>类型的英语成绩在</span></span></span><span><span><span>2022</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>月及以后获得方为有效；</span></span></span><span><span><span>4-5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>类型的英语成绩（</span><a href=\"http://www.cab.zju.edu.cn/chinese/2026/0822/c11167a3196178/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>不认可家庭版和拼分成绩</span></a><span>）有效期参照证书有效期；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>6. </span><span>在母语为英语的国家学习并获得前置学历学位。</span></p><p><span>浙江大学认可的母语为英语的国家：美属萨摩亚、澳大利亚、巴哈马、巴巴多斯、贝利兹、博茨瓦纳、加拿大、斐济、直布罗陀、加纳、圭亚那、爱尔兰、牙买加、肯尼亚、莱索托、利比里亚、新西兰、尼日利亚、巴布亚新几内亚、新加坡、所罗门群岛、南非、冈比亚、汤加、英国、美国、赞比亚、津巴布韦。</span></p><p><span>7.</span><span><span> </span><span>“</span></span><span>少数民族高层次骨干人才计划</span><span>”</span><span>（以下简称骨干计划）</span><span>等国家专项计划在职定向考生：新大学英语六级</span><span>426</span><span>及以上或旧大学英语六级合格及以上或英语专业八级合格或</span><span>WSK</span><span>（</span><span>PETS 5</span><span>）合格。或其他英语成绩水平同上</span><span>2-6</span><span>所述。</span></p><p><span><span>       </span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"52c2e28fb856adbef74199f743d6244523f0362c8fa9a61eaf5391130f892d39","textLength":582,"sourceSha256":"7ecf33bed998834094412f3d6581f4ef6aae6692b0ada0a6128470e05224753a","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7ac129b2996eb506a0b5","title":"2026年浙江大学农业与生物技术学院关于2027年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:12.643879+00: